here's margin upside as you realize the cost savings of that strategy.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2018 Q4","e":"hii","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"So that is absolutely behind us we saw in the facility the restructuring is fully and that's covered.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2019 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Spingarn","x":"Just continue on the talk about carriers, Mike, with the two carrier buy since, I guess, in theory the two ships are being spec-ed in tandem, I would imagine where a lot of this cost savings comes from.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2019 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Petters","x":"…manage and execute the work.As a result of our review, we recognize the forward loss and we are restructuring and adding talent to the program and execution teams in order to ensure that the work is performed, with the highest quality and that the ship is returned to the fleet as soon as…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2019 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"Remember, over the last few years we did have restructuring in the working capital, so it should definitely come down from there, but at the end of last year was kind of an outlier.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2020 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Petters","x":"Schools were closing; many companies were forced to layoff portions or in some cases all of their workforce; and in some parts of the country, people were being told to isolate.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2020 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2020-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Akers","x":"You maintained the guidance for the year, even though it sounds like CapEx is maybe a little bit higher in the shipbuilding outlook a little bit worse.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2020 Q4","e":"hii","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Petters","x":"And we’ve taken 15% of the man hours out of the Kennedy between Ford and Kennedy, and we streamline the supply chain, and so we're taking cost out of that ship.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2022 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2022-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"Beyond Shipbuilding the fiscal year 2023 request reflects an emphasis on research and development with the increased investments in capability enablers such as AI, Cyber, Electronic Warfare, C5, ISR and autonomous systems.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2022 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2022-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"On the new bids, I'll tell you that we're very, we are seeing on new bids price increases along the lead times and we're seeing higher costs kind of year-over-year but we ensure that we follow that same dedicated process of getting live quotes.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2022 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2022-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Gautam Khanna","x":"How do you recover those, what does that do to margins, is just a pass-through where it actually dampens margins, just if you could walk through the mechanics there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2022 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2022-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"I still think on the back end, the reason why we haven't raised guidance is we don't have as many milestones.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2022 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2022-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Spingarn","x":"But on this potential 5-unit block buy for the Columbia class, could you talk about what that might mean for Huntington Ingalls as a cost savings and labor continuity opportunity?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2022 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2022-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"We are increasing our guidance for 2022 [ph].","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2023 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2023-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"Beyond shipbuilding, the fiscal year 2024 request reflects continued investments in capability enablers, such as AI, cyber and electronic warfare, C5ISR and autonomous systems, which align well with the advanced technology capabilities of our Mission Technologies division.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2023 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2023-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"I do think as we -- as I mentioned about restructuring in the rear-view mirror and the team even more focused and experience working together over there, the additions of the Chief Technology Officer that we have here, Eric Tuning, has been from executive S&D, all those will help mature that…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2023 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2023-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"We are reaffirming our 2023 guidance and providing some color on how we see the second quarter shaping up.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2023 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2023-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"Before discussing our second quarter outlook, I want to make clear that we are reaffirming our guidance for the full year with the knowledge that once the PSA modification is completed, the remaining CVN 79 milestones will be updated, including moving the delivery to 2025.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2023 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2023-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Stiehle","x":"And, I think we're in the lane right now to kind of we're reaffirming our guidance there on profitability for shipbuilding between [indiscernible].","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2023 Q4","e":"hii","d":"2024-02-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Stiehle","x":"And then the difference between the increased guide in Q3 of $500 million to $597 million, with strong collections in Q4.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2024 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2024-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"We are also investing in data analytics and pilot projects utilizing AI to find faster solutions to material delivery delays and mitigate their impacts to ship assembly schedules.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2024 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2024-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"…align acquisition was in 2021 and each year we're finding opportunity sense to either take more cost out or get some additional synergies within the division and the interfacing within shipbuilding and the opportunity set there continue to grow and how we can leverage Mission Technologies'…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2024 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2024-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"So -- and but we're still -- if you notice, we're raising the guide both on the top line and the bottom line at Mission Technologies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2024 Q4","e":"hii","d":"2025-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"To close my remarks, achieving the throughput, cost reduction, and contract award initiatives that we have outlined are critical to stabilizing shipbuilding performance in 2025 and achieving the outlook we have provided.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2024 Q4","e":"hii","d":"2025-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"I think we have the pieces in place and where we are short on people, the cost reduction initiatives that we have right now, and we've talked about the contracts.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"I'll note that we do not expect a material impact related to tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"We have long-term purchase agreements in place for material that may be impacted by tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"Turning to our cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"Plans are in place, and we intend to reach our goal of $250 million in annualized cost reduction by year's end.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2025-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"Let me start by briefly discussing our first quarter results, and then I will address our reaffirmed outlook for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Kastner","x":"The second operational initiative is our $250 million annualized cost reduction effort, and we remain on track to achieve this target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/huntington-ingalls-hii-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q3","e":"hii","d":"2025-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"And we're just reiterating the guide that we gave you at the beginning of the year from 5.5% to 6%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/huntington-ingalls-hii-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HII 2025 Q4","e":"hii","d":"2026-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Stiehle","x":"Although your question was specifically on the return on sales side, the EBIT side, I tell you on the EBITDA side, you saw we raised the guidance from eight o to from eight to eight five last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/huntington-ingalls-hii-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HII 2026 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Stiehle","x":"As far as opportunity set, I mean, obviously, there's opportunities and risks around that, but we're reaffirming the guide for the end of the year at $500 million to $600 million, and we'll keep you informed as we move forward here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/hii-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HII 2026 Q1","e":"hii","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Stiehle","x":"And as we increase the guidance from 4% to 6% last year, we said we'd take a look at it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/hii-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HII 2026 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Doug Harned","x":"First, how important it is on the revenue side, that should be a pass-through, as a second part, how that's helping you improve your performance and your throughput.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/huntington-ingalls-hii-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HII 2026 Q2","e":"hii","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Stiehle","x":"And now raising the guidance from 6% to 6.5% to now 6.0% to 6.5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/huntington-ingalls-hii-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,7771,0,0,0,1652,5588],[34,1,8092,0,0,0,5436,2096],[35,1,8340,0,0,0,16,7823],[36,1,8558,0,0,0,6140,1998],[37,1,9079,0,0,0,6661,1938],[38,1,9483,0,0,0,6496,2421],[39,1,8009,0,0,0,6182,1394],[40,1,9297,0,0,0,6765,1979],[41,1,9545,0,0,0,7427,1717],[42,1,9088,0,0,0,6680,1883],[43,1,8718,0,0,0,6265,2075],[44,1,7008,0,0,0,4813,1760],[45,1,8922,0,0,0,6751,1763],[46,1,7204,0,0,0,5068,1705],[47,1,7606,0,0,0,4142,3011],[48,1,9809,0,0,0,7165,1758],[49,1,6677,0,0,0,4763,1513],[50,1,7096,0,0,0,5488,1208],[51,1,7811,0,0,0,2998,4409],[52,1,10659,0,0,0,8094,1936],[53,1,9121,0,0,0,7035,1627],[54,1,8066,0,0,0,5949,1563],[55,1,6175,0,0,0,4795,874],[56,1,9450,0,0,0,7384,1548],[57,1,3568,0,0,0,1919,1344],[58,1,7627,0,0,0,5696,1453],[59,1,11982,0,0,0,9652,1728],[60,1,8843,0,0,0,3223,4989],[61,1,7849,0,0,0,5714,1655],[63,1,6719,0,0,0,5143,1148],[64,1,9865,0,0,0,7444,1883],[65,1,7120,0,0,0,5680,1160],[66,1,9984,0,0,0,7776,1549],[67,1,8192,0,0,0,6534,1057]],"cinema":[[33,1,7771,0,0,0,1652,5588],[34,1,8092,0,0,0,5436,2096],[35,1,8340,0,0,0,16,7823],[36,1,8558,0,0,0,6140,1998],[37,1,9079,0,0,0,6661,1938],[38,1,9483,0,0,0,6496,2421],[39,1,8009,0,0,0,6182,1394],[40,1,9297,0,0,0,6765,1979],[41,1,9545,0,0,0,7427,1717],[42,1,9088,0,0,0,6680,1883],[43,1,8718,0,0,0,6265,20